  "about": "µLearn MESCAS was officially launched on August 19, 2025, marking the beginning of a vibrant, student-driven learning community on campus. With Humraz as the Campus Lead, Shiyas as the Co-Lead, and Shareeq as the Faculty Enabler, µLearn at MESCAS started its mission to build a culture of collaborative growth, peer-to-peer learning,and skill development.The community was founded with the vision of helping students break out of echo chambers, think creatively, and step beyond the limitations of conventional learning. Through micro peer groups, challenges, and hands-on activities, µLearn MESCAS aims to create an environment where students uplift each other, grow together, and prepare for real-world opportunities",

